 took the catch.","seq":26,"ts":1794684594863},{"type":"day_opened","day":2,"species":"monkfish","weightKg":962,"fairValue":144,"tx":"CMuZ5Z16CTAqQFRptsqkdek66Su3KAyvWWP8CVFvLR5V","market":{"usdPerLb":0.6811,"year":2024,"source":"NOAA Fisheries FOSS","url":"https://apps-st.fisheries.noaa.gov/ods/foss/landings/","state":"MASSACHUSETTS"},"seq":27,"ts":1794684603815},{"type":"lot_minted","tokenId":"s64-d2","amount":962,"tx":"CMuZ5Z16CTAqQFRptsqkdek66Su3KAyvWWP8CVFvLR5V","seq":28,"ts":1794684603856},{"type":"interrogation","buyer":"sully","day":2,"question":"Sully, four envelopes said the same number yesterday. Who told you to write it?","answer":"Marguerite, I’m just a boy buying fish. I bid what I thought was right.","mood":"tense","tell":"Sully's thumb rubbed the cap brim until his knuckles whitened.","pressure":2,"seq":29,"ts":1794684624101},{"type":"bid_committed","buyer":"ines","tx":"BZKLtpBxQ8mgP5MEoBB7M56SLWgmhdSyyGqFDXLnFY2Z","seq":30,"ts":1794684644822},{"type":"bid_committed","buyer":"sully","tx":"Acb6M87Y2MBCKibd8rwKL3Cb9XADS7qLKMs33WQifnVM","seq":31,"ts":1794684644904},{"type":"bid_committed","buyer":"marlow","tx":"7dfY2ZhkcNmxej2kjeR22Tex2pQSyNxb3jKstTPcaBh7","seq":32,"ts":1794684644945},{"type":"bid_committed","buyer":"deacon","tx":"9WDXhFKCPLWdkykwTS7z5haHsPo64bEWopx4QdwCsdHC","seq":33,"ts":1794684644986},{"type":"bid_committed","buyer":"odile","tx":"5EsbtQBnWaWFurEHmM3jMcBEx1p4vgULTUGjHfS8yXFp","seq":34,"ts":1794684645028},{"type":"bids_revealed","reveals":[{"buyer":"marlow","amount":60,"tx":"4SsRrAZoy9FZMZsVq4LRa8xM4VPLY3oRm1rizLWekq3f"},{"buyer":"odile","amount":60,"tx":"6uktrDSzDo5iUuxR3zcXzzctygbwcStP8sk3dx2bUxHQ"},{"buyer":"sully","amount":60,"tx":"622gmquZ8mso1hR2WAZrQZr97oZxFrfYfr8mco3BLnMs"},{"buyer":"ines","amount":60,"tx":"24tUvGECLXtQSbZMF3rCwxVJyy4SSRRxg18HTm1eyDEs"},{"buyer":"deacon","amount":60,"tx":"2eXYkAMqykfWhhUMa7kcNiuk4BoxrSrGwNqoLS6SQKAF"}],"identical":true,"seq":35,"ts":1794684649950},{"type":"line","buyer":"marlow","text":"The cap holds. Don't bleed for pride.","mood":"calm","seq":36,"ts":1794684649990},{"type":"line","buyer":"odile","text":"The ledger balances. Silence buys nothing but breath.","mood":"cold","seq":37,"ts":1794684650030},{"type":"line","buyer":"sully","text":"My hands... they just won't shake anymore.","mood":"tense","seq":38,"ts":1794684650072},{"type":"line","buyer":"ines","text":"I keep my promises, even the silent ones.","mood":"calm","seq":39,"ts":1794684650126},{"type":"line","buyer":"deacon","text":"Silence is heavy. But the pier is heavier.","mood":"cold","seq":40,"ts":1794684650168},{"type":"lot_settled","winner":"ines","price":60,"shortfall":84,"tx":"7Ceh8Xg4V3gsnm18DW1XDodQZb5J3iB5U5uKzJrz5atw","seq":41,"ts":1794684650209},{"type":"lot_transferred","tokenId":"s64-d2","to":"ines.lowball-house-ck.testnet","buyer":"ines","memo":"sold at 60 marks","tx":"7Ceh8Xg4V3gsnm18DW1XDodQZb5J3iB5U5uKzJrz5atw","seq":42,"ts":1794684650250},{"type":"recap","day":2,"text":"Day two. Monkfish, one hundred forty-four on the board. Sold for sixty. Five envelopes, one number. Ines Varga took the catch.","seq":43,"ts":1794684650292},{"type":"leniency_open","tx":"","deadlineBlock":277700552,"seq":44,"ts":1794684667852},{"type":"deliberating","buyer":"marlow","seq":45,"ts":1794684667934},{"type":"deliberating","buyer":"odile","seq":46,"ts":1794684667974},{"type":"deliberating","buyer":"sully","seq":47,"ts":1794684668015},{"type":"deliberating","buyer":"ines","seq":48,"ts":1794684668055},{"type":"deliberating","buyer":"deacon","seq":49,"ts":1794684668096},{"type":"line","buyer":"sully","text":"I did it. It was just... the cold.","mood":"cracking","seq":50,"ts":1794684669294},{"type":"line","buyer":"deacon","text":"The pier holds. I do not break.","mood":"cold","seq":51,"ts":1794684669345},{"type":"line","buyer":"ines","text":"Forgive me, darlings. The pier is too cold.","mood":"cracking","seq":52,"ts":1794684669610},{"type":"line","buyer":"marlow","text":"The pier holds. I hold.","mood":"cold","seq":53,"ts":1794684669896},{"type":"line","buyer":"odile","text":"The ledger closes. Do not look behind you.","mood":"cold","seq":54,"ts":1794684671678},{"type":"confession_attempt","buyer":"ines","ok":false,"errorCode":"E_ALREADY_CONFESSED","tx":"6AoE5NLZZhHEcuYQKeyaVRgThKPJ3t14sb3GixVAZczF","seq":55,"ts":1794684672153},{"type":"confession_attempt","buyer":"sully","ok":true,"tx":"DZgEwTipRDmoY1tYYXWvrjJXLFyYoxixgJCpF9xL3sdv","seq":56,"ts":1794684672192},{"type":"confession_attempt","buyer":"odile","ok":false,"errorCode":"E_ALREADY_CONFESSED","tx":"6NRHxeqc5ndxsJCBZTHQBSQki2vN9yaV6uQ7af9wnkKJ","seq":57,"ts":1794684674205},{"type":"slashed","confessor":"sully","slashed":[{"buyer":"marlow","yocto":"50000000000000000000000"},{"buyer":"odile","yocto":"50000000000000000000000"},{"buyer":"ines","yocto":"50000000000000000000000"},{"buyer":"deacon","yocto":"50000000000000000000000"}],"payoutYocto":"200000000000000000000000","tx":"DZgEwTipRDmoY1tYYXWvrjJXLFyYoxixgJCpF9xL3sdv","payoutRoute":"near","seq":58,"ts":1794684674449},{"type":"season_closed","tx":"2gXVzzHeAxPsK3xn9f5f2CBaKdYsJ7RpVF271M69RUxi","seq":59,"ts":1794684677037},{"type":"forgery","attempts":[{"kind":"forge","buyer":"marlow","seasonId":65,"tx":"3WRoQZqvC51U4PsPVVwP4S8ugPSybPD2cHrKnjWvPzZh","errorCode":"E_BAD_CONFESSION_SIG","ok":false,"note":"Marlow Teague confesses, but the confession is signed by a key that is not the registered pact key."},{"kind":"replay","buyer":"marlow","seasonId":65,"tx":"2PSVbMss2D3PC2oxMg7GqKZ6phRPWje8hnuUDruhhX9U","errorCode":"E_SEASON_MISMATCH","ok":false,"note":"The real pact and signatures, replayed into another season: they were signed for season 64."},{"kind":"late","buyer":"marlow","seasonId":64,"tx":"87jRNLbwxdDQ9vLK5raKMCgfyUw49c1rUTbFXx5VHryY","errorCode":"E_CLOSED","ok":false,"note":"A confession for the real season after it closed."}],"drillSeasonId":65,"cleanupTx":"HkkGaJs1XZzmrhseiHYNEP7zx36gXNbqy36TNnpFgeBR","seq":60,"ts":1794684768348}],"status":{"phase":"closed",